;; Primary-only channel configuration for the workstation.
;; XLibre is included in SecurityOps; no external XLibre channel is needed.
;; The small-guix fork has an explicit signed SecurityOps trust checkpoint.
;; gocix and sops-guix are transitive dependencies of small-guix.
;; All client-side channel URLs use the owner's primary Forgejo namespace.
;; Other upstream revision pins are preserved.

